DETAIL:  advice: track_changes = the table has no one-column primary key; rollup_columns = scope_id, dim_a_id
HINT:  Reasons, costs and how to turn each off: SELECT * FROM sift.index_choices('copy_part_p1_scope_id_id_dim_a_id_kind_amount_idx');
NOTICE:  sift_col index "copy_part_p2_scope_id_id_dim_a_id_kind_amount_idx": 1 automatic choice, 1 advice
DETAIL:  advice: track_changes = the table has no one-column primary key; rollup_columns = scope_id, dim_a_id
HINT:  Reasons, costs and how to turn each off: SELECT * FROM sift.index_choices('copy_part_p2_scope_id_id_dim_a_id_kind_amount_idx');
